WEBVTT

00:09.034 --> 00:10.137
Are you ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.241 --> 00:11.931
Aye, aye, Captain!
是啊是啊，队长！

00:12.034 --> 00:13.137
I can't hear you.
我听不到你说话。

00:13.241 --> 00:15.586
Aye, aye, Captain!
是啊是啊，队长！

00:15.689 --> 00:17.724
♪ Ooh!
♪ 哦！

00:17.827 --> 00:20.137
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:20.241 --> 00:22.000
♪ Spongebob Squarepants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:22.103 --> 00:23.965
♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he ♪
♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的 ♪

00:24.068 --> 00:25.724
♪ Spongebob
Squarepants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝
方裤！ ♪

00:25.827 --> 00:28.241
♪ If nautical nonsense
be something you wish ♪
♪ 如果是航海废话
成为你想要的东西♪

00:28.344 --> 00:29.724
♪ Spongebob Squarepants! ♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:29.827 --> 00:31.862
♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish ♪
♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通♪

00:31.965 --> 00:34.241
♪ Spongebob Squarepants!♪ready?
♪ 海绵宝宝！♪ 准备好了吗？

00:34.344 --> 00:36.241
♪ Spongebob Squarepants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:36.344 --> 00:38.620
♪ Spongebob Squarepants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:38.724 --> 00:40.172
♪ Spongebob Squarepants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:40.275 --> 00:43.965
♪ Spongebob Squarepants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:50.862 --> 00:56.103
[Captioning sponsored by THE
U.S. DEPARTMENT OF EDUCATION
[字幕由THE赞助
美国教育部

00:56.206 --> 01:00.448
[and NICKELODEON]
[和尼克频道]

01:08.275 --> 01:10.310
And there's that and here we go.
就是这样，我们开始吧。

01:20.000 --> 01:23.413
Wey, wook, it's Windward.
韦，哇，这是迎风。

01:23.517 --> 01:24.517
What?
什么？

01:27.275 --> 01:29.862
Windward's wolling to work.
Windward 愿意工作。

01:33.034 --> 01:38.689
Where does he work?
Wat the Wusty Wab?
他在哪里工作？
乌斯蒂瓦布在哪里？

01:40.379 --> 01:45.241
What's that supposed to be,
some kind of stupid secret code?
那应该是什么，
某种愚蠢的密码？

01:45.344 --> 01:46.448
We can't tell you
我们不能告诉你

01:46.551 --> 01:48.758
'cause you're not
a member of the club.
因为你不是
俱乐部的成员。

01:48.862 --> 01:49.931
Oh, yeah?
哦，是吗？

01:50.034 --> 01:52.000
What does it take to be a member
成为会员需要什么

01:52.103 --> 01:53.931
besides being a moron?
除了是个白痴之外？

01:55.724 --> 01:56.758
Moron...
白痴...

01:56.862 --> 01:58.517
as a requirement.
作为要求。

01:58.620 --> 02:02.000
Sorry, Squidward,
but you couldn't get in
对不起，章鱼哥，
但你无法进入

02:02.103 --> 02:03.551
even if you tried.
即使你尝试过。

02:03.655 --> 02:07.103
Well, I'll have you know
that I am a member
好吧，我会让你知道的
我是会员

02:07.206 --> 02:09.965
of over 20 different
exclusive clubs
超过20种不同的
专属俱乐部

02:10.068 --> 02:12.586
all across the sea bottom.
全部在海底。

02:12.689 --> 02:13.517
What did he say?
他说什么？

02:13.620 --> 02:14.379
I don't know.
我不知道。

02:14.482 --> 02:15.827
Something about his nose.
关于他的鼻子。

02:15.931 --> 02:19.275
Squidward, you
and your nose will
definitely not fit in.
章鱼哥你
你的鼻子会
绝对不适合。

02:19.379 --> 02:24.034
Oh, what do you two zeros know
about fitting in?
哦，你们两个零知道什么
关于适应？

02:24.137 --> 02:27.172
You should be
begging me to join.
你应该是
恳求我加入。

02:27.275 --> 02:28.931
Stop! No, no, no!
停止！不，不，不！

02:29.034 --> 02:31.103
Stop. Stop, Squidward.
停止。停下来，章鱼哥。

02:31.206 --> 02:33.551
You can't join. Can't join.
你不能加入。无法加入。

02:33.655 --> 02:34.689
You can't get in.
你进不去。

02:36.862 --> 02:39.103
Well, this is stupid.
嗯，这很愚蠢。

02:39.206 --> 02:42.034
There's no room up here.
这里没有空间了。

02:42.137 --> 02:44.448
That's what we've been
trying to tell you.
这就是我们一直以来的样子
试图告诉你。

02:44.551 --> 02:46.862
We've been stuck up
here for three days.
我们一直被困住
在这里呆了三天。

02:46.965 --> 02:50.000
We told you you wouldn't fit in.
我们告诉过你你不适合。

02:51.172 --> 02:52.355
Well, since you're here,
Squidward
好吧，既然你来了，
章鱼哥

02:52.379 --> 02:54.655
we'll give you
the new member
initiation.
我们会给你
新成员
启动。

02:54.758 --> 02:55.896
Are you ready, Patrick?
你准备好了吗，帕特里克？

02:56.000 --> 02:57.275
Ready.
准备好。

02:57.379 --> 02:58.527
♪ Welcome to our club,
welcome to our club ♪
♪ 欢迎来到我们的俱乐部，
欢迎来到我们的俱乐部♪

02:58.551 --> 03:00.275
♪ Welcome Squidward,
welcome, Squidward ♪
♪ 欢迎章鱼哥，
欢迎，章鱼哥♪

03:00.379 --> 03:03.034
♪ Welcome, Squidward,
welcome, Squidward... ♪
♪ 欢迎，章鱼哥，
欢迎，章鱼哥……♪

03:03.137 --> 03:06.103
Shut your half-wit pie holes!
闭上你那笨蛋的洞吧！

03:06.206 --> 03:09.862
I do not now nor will I ever
我现在不会，将来也不会

03:09.965 --> 03:16.896
want to be a member
of your stupid club.
想成为会员
你这个愚蠢的俱乐部。

03:24.448 --> 03:27.758
Make a wish, honey.
许个愿吧，亲爱的。

03:33.517 --> 03:35.862
Woo-woo-woo! Woo-hoo!
呜呜呜！呜呼！

03:35.965 --> 03:37.655
Again! Again! Again!
再次！再次！再次！

03:40.517 --> 03:41.620
This didn't just happen.
这并不是刚刚发生的。

03:41.724 --> 03:43.965
Please, tell me
that didn't happen.
请告诉我
但那并没有发生。

03:44.068 --> 03:45.344
What happened?
发生了什么？

03:45.448 --> 03:47.079
Where are we?! We're lost!
There's no way out.
我们在哪里？！我们迷路了！
没有出路。

03:47.103 --> 03:54.172
Stuck in the middle of nowhere
with Spongebob and Patrick!
被困在一个偏僻的地方
与海绵宝宝和帕特里克！

03:54.275 --> 03:58.862
Oh, why must every 11 minutes
of my life
哦，为什么必须每 11 分钟一次
我的生活

03:58.965 --> 04:01.793
be filled with misery? Why?!
充满痛苦吗？为什么？！

04:01.896 --> 04:04.172
Oh, cheer up, Squid.
It could be worse.
噢，振作起来，鱿鱼。
情况可能会更糟。

04:04.275 --> 04:07.724
Yeah, you could
be bald and have
a big nose.
是的，你可以
秃头并且有
一个大鼻子。

04:09.172 --> 04:12.103
Well, this is the end.
好了，这就是结局了。

04:12.206 --> 04:14.068
No, it's not, Squidward.
不，不是的，章鱼哥。

04:14.172 --> 04:16.137
It's not?
它不是？

04:16.241 --> 04:17.620
Come on, guys.
来吧，伙计们。

04:17.724 --> 04:19.965
We're going to be fine
as long as we stick together.
我们会没事的
只要我们粘在一起。

04:20.068 --> 04:21.413
Remember, we're a club.
请记住，我们是一个俱乐部。

04:23.655 --> 04:27.172
And besides, we have this.
除此之外，我们还有这个。

04:27.275 --> 04:28.275
What's that?
那是什么？

04:28.344 --> 04:30.517
Oh, the magic conch shell.
哦，神奇的海螺壳。

04:30.620 --> 04:33.655
Ask it something!
Ask it something!
有事问它吧！
有事问它吧！

04:33.758 --> 04:39.137
Magic conch shell,
will I ever get married?
神奇的海螺壳，
我会结婚吗？

04:39.241 --> 04:41.000
Maybe someday.
也许有一天。

04:44.275 --> 04:46.482
You've got to be kidding!
你一定是在开玩笑！

04:46.586 --> 04:48.965
That is just a stupid toy.
那只是一个愚蠢的玩具。

04:49.068 --> 04:50.379
How can that possibly help us?
这对我们有什么帮助呢？

04:50.482 --> 04:54.068
Squidward, we must never
question the wisdom
章鱼哥，我们绝不能
质疑智慧

04:54.172 --> 04:55.206
of the magic conch.
的魔法海螺。

04:55.310 --> 04:57.103
The club always takes its advice
俱乐部始终听取其建议

04:57.206 --> 04:58.344
before we do anything.
在我们做任何事情之前。

04:58.448 --> 05:01.275
The shell knows all.
外壳知道一切。

05:01.379 --> 05:02.931
Oh, magic conch shell
哦，神奇的海螺壳

05:03.034 --> 05:07.586
what do we need to do
to get out of the kelp forest?
我们需要做什么
走出海带森林？

05:09.310 --> 05:11.137
Nothing.
没有什么。

05:11.241 --> 05:12.517
The shell has spoken!
贝壳说话了！

05:12.620 --> 05:18.068
Nothing? We can't just sit here
and do nothing.
没有什么？我们不能只是坐在这里
并什么都不做。

05:21.241 --> 05:24.241
I can't believe
you two are going
我不敢相信
你们两个要去

05:24.344 --> 05:26.034
to take advice from a toy.
从玩具那里获取建议。

05:26.137 --> 05:29.206
All right, all right.
I don't need your help.
好吧，好吧。
我不需要你的帮助。

05:29.310 --> 05:32.034
I am going to find my way
back to sanity.
我会找到我的路
恢复理智。

05:32.137 --> 05:35.448
But don't you two sad clowns
come crying to me
但你们两个悲伤的小丑难道不是吗？
来找我哭吧

05:35.551 --> 05:39.241
when your circus tent
comes crashing down.
当你的马戏团帐篷
崩溃了。

05:39.344 --> 05:40.344
Sad clown.
悲伤的小丑。

05:41.551 --> 05:44.137
Sad... clown.
悲伤……小丑。

05:49.034 --> 05:50.379
What was that?
那是什么？

05:50.482 --> 05:52.965
I was already here!
我已经在这里了！

05:53.068 --> 05:55.931
Which way do I go?!
我该走哪条路？！

05:56.034 --> 05:59.620
Oh, I'm lost!
哦，我迷路了！

06:01.724 --> 06:05.448
Oh, I'm hopelessly lost!
哦，我彻底迷失了！

06:05.551 --> 06:08.896
I'll never get out of here!
我永远不会离开这里！

06:09.000 --> 06:10.000
Huh?
啊？

06:16.344 --> 06:18.586
I'm free!
我自由了！

06:18.689 --> 06:22.068
Take that,
Spongebob and Patrick!
就拿那个来说，
海绵宝宝和帕特里克！

06:28.000 --> 06:29.103
Huh?
啊？

06:29.206 --> 06:30.241
Oh...
哦...

06:30.344 --> 06:33.896
There's no way out of here.
没有办法离开这里。

06:37.586 --> 06:42.482
How's it going over there
at Club Shell for Brains?
那边怎么样
在大脑壳俱乐部？

06:42.586 --> 06:44.034
Mm-mm-mm. I am hungry.
嗯嗯嗯。我饿了。

06:44.137 --> 06:49.379
I wonder what's on the menu
for Club Squidward tonight.
我想知道菜单上有什么
今晚为《章鱼俱乐部》。

06:50.862 --> 06:51.931
Ah.
啊。

06:55.068 --> 06:57.310
Smell good, Spongebob?
海绵宝宝，味道好闻吗？

06:57.413 --> 07:00.241
You haven't eaten in days...
你好几天没吃饭了...

07:00.344 --> 07:02.034
What about you, Patrick?
你呢，帕特里克？

07:02.137 --> 07:05.310
A big boy's got to eat.
一个大男孩就得吃饭。

07:05.413 --> 07:07.310
Well, you can't have any.
好吧，你不能有任何。

07:07.413 --> 07:09.448
And do you know why, Spongebob?
你知道为什么吗，海绵宝宝？

07:09.551 --> 07:12.448
Because your club president
is a shell.
因为你们的俱乐部主席
是一个外壳。

07:12.551 --> 07:13.896
If you had listened to me
如果你听我的话

07:14.000 --> 07:17.379
you'd have food, shelter
and a roaring fire
你会有食物、住所
和熊熊的火焰

07:17.482 --> 07:22.172
but instead you listened
to a talking clam
但你却听了
会说话的蛤蜊

07:22.275 --> 07:23.620
that tells you nothing.
那什么也没告诉你。

07:23.724 --> 07:26.448
'Cause the answers
to all your problems
因为答案
解决你所有的问题

07:26.551 --> 07:29.379
will fall right out of the sky.
会从天上掉下来。

07:30.793 --> 07:34.241
Fall right out of the sky.
直接从天上掉下来。

07:35.034 --> 07:38.172
Dude, we're falling
right out of the sky!
兄弟，我们正在坠落
就在天上！

07:38.275 --> 07:39.862
We got to drop the load!
我们必须放下负载！

07:53.724 --> 07:58.517
Praise the magic conch!
赞美神奇的海螺！

08:04.206 --> 08:05.862
Mm, mm.
嗯，嗯。

08:15.517 --> 08:17.482
Hey, Spongebob, that sure is
嘿，海绵宝宝，那确实是

08:17.586 --> 08:19.724
a lot of food you got there.
你那里有很多食物。

08:19.827 --> 08:22.689
It's a gift
from the magic conch.
这是一份礼物
来自魔法海螺。

08:22.793 --> 08:25.724
Everything sure looks delicious.
一切看起来都很美味。

08:25.827 --> 08:29.620
Ooh, smoked sausages,
my favorite.
哦，熏香肠，
我最喜欢的。

08:37.103 --> 08:38.517
Uh, hey, Spongebob
呃，嘿，海绵宝宝

08:38.620 --> 08:43.586
you know I was just
kidding around earlier.
你知道我只是
之前开玩笑。

08:43.689 --> 08:45.896
I mean, I'm still part
of the club, right?
我的意思是，我仍然是一部分
俱乐部的，对吧？

08:46.000 --> 08:50.413
And after all, the club
got to stick together.
毕竟俱乐部
必须粘在一起。

08:50.517 --> 08:51.379
I mean, you know...
我的意思是，你知道...

08:51.482 --> 08:52.344
Squidward.
章鱼哥。

08:52.448 --> 08:53.448
Yes?
是的？

08:53.517 --> 08:55.344
Once a member, always a member.
一旦是会员，永远是会员。

08:55.448 --> 08:57.413
To the club!
去俱乐部！

08:59.310 --> 09:00.379
Yeah.
是的。

09:01.862 --> 09:03.689
Now, if you'll excuse me.
现在，请原谅。

09:03.793 --> 09:05.206
What shall I eat first
我先吃什么

09:05.310 --> 09:07.551
the spaghetti, the turkey,
the soup, the canned meat?
意大利面、火鸡、
汤，肉罐头？

09:07.655 --> 09:10.931
Why don't you ask
the magic conch, Squidward?
你为什么不问
神奇海螺，章鱼哥？

09:11.034 --> 09:12.655
Oh, yeah, like that'll happen.
哦，是的，就像那样会发生。

09:12.758 --> 09:16.275
Right after I consult
the magic toenail.
我咨询后立即
神奇的脚趾甲。

09:17.172 --> 09:20.068
Squidward, are you questioning
章鱼哥，你在质疑吗

09:20.172 --> 09:23.551
the authority
of the magic conch?
当局
魔法海螺的？

09:23.655 --> 09:26.103
The conch is the one
who gave us this banquet.
海螺就是那一个
谁为我们举办了这场宴会。

09:26.206 --> 09:28.586
This copyrighted conch
is the cornerstone
这个受版权保护的海螺
是基石

09:28.689 --> 09:29.689
of our organization.
我们组织的。

09:29.724 --> 09:32.344
Maybe he's not a brother.
也许他不是兄弟。

09:32.448 --> 09:35.448
You guys have it all wrong.
你们都错了。

09:35.551 --> 09:39.068
I love this piece of plastic.
我喜欢这块塑料。

09:39.172 --> 09:41.275
Hello, there.
你好呀。

09:41.379 --> 09:44.241
Magic conch, I was wondering
神奇海螺，我想知道

09:44.344 --> 09:48.862
should I have the spaghetti
or the turkey?
我应该吃意大利面吗
还是火鸡？

09:48.965 --> 09:49.689
Neither.
两者都不。

09:49.793 --> 09:52.517
Oh. Then how about the soup?
哦。那么汤呢？

09:52.620 --> 09:53.655
I don't think so.
我不这么认为。

09:53.758 --> 09:55.896
Can I have anything to eat?
我可以吃点什么吗？

09:56.000 --> 09:56.620
No.
不。

09:56.724 --> 09:57.517
No? What do you mean no?
不？你说不是什么意思？

09:57.620 --> 09:58.379
I'm starving here!
我这里快饿死了！

09:58.482 --> 09:59.793
Here, let me try.
来，让我试试。

09:59.896 --> 10:03.620
Magic conch, could Squidward
have some of this
神奇海螺，章鱼哥
有一些这个

10:03.724 --> 10:08.275
yummy, delicious,
super-terrific sandwich?
美味的，可口的，
超级棒的三明治？

10:08.379 --> 10:10.137
No.
不。

10:10.241 --> 10:11.241
Hmm. Could I have this
唔。我可以要这个吗

10:11.310 --> 10:14.275
yummy, delicious,
super terrific sandwich?
美味的，可口的，
超级棒的三明治？

10:14.379 --> 10:15.206
Yes.
是的。

10:15.310 --> 10:16.310
All right!
好的！

10:20.482 --> 10:21.482
Sorry, Squidward.
对不起，章鱼哥。

10:21.551 --> 10:22.586
Give me that!
给我那个！

10:22.689 --> 10:24.103
Could I have something to eat?
我可以吃点东西吗？

10:24.206 --> 10:24.965
No.
不。

10:25.068 --> 10:26.275
Could I have something to eat?
我可以吃点东西吗？

10:26.379 --> 10:27.413
No.
不。

10:27.517 --> 10:28.344
Could I have something to eat?
我可以吃点东西吗？

10:28.448 --> 10:29.724
No.
不。

10:29.827 --> 10:31.182
Can't you say anything else
but no?
你就不能说点别的吗
但没有？

10:31.206 --> 10:32.551
Try asking again.
尝试再次询问。

10:32.655 --> 10:34.344
Can I have something to eat?
我可以吃点东西吗？

10:34.448 --> 10:35.482
No.
不。

10:38.655 --> 10:42.103
Squidward, are you all right?
章鱼哥，你还好吗？

10:42.206 --> 10:46.000
Maybe we should ask
the shell if he's okay.
也许我们应该问
如果他没事的话。

10:46.931 --> 10:50.379
Hello, anyone there?
Hello? Hello?
你好，有人在吗？
你好？你好？

10:55.655 --> 10:57.413
Do you folks need some help?
你们需要帮助吗？

10:57.517 --> 10:59.000
I'm saved!
我得救了！

10:59.103 --> 11:02.000
You don't know how happy
I am to see you.
你不知道有多幸福
我是来见你的。

11:02.103 --> 11:04.724
I've been stranded
out here for weeks
我已被困
在这里呆了几个星期

11:04.827 --> 11:07.620
with these two barnacle-heads
和这两个藤壶头

11:07.724 --> 11:09.655
and their magic conch shell.
和他们的神奇海螺壳。

11:09.758 --> 11:13.206
Magic conch shell?
神奇的海螺壳？

11:13.310 --> 11:14.827
You mean like this?!
你的意思是这样？！

11:14.931 --> 11:20.000
Magic conch! A club member!
神奇海螺！俱乐部会员！

11:24.758 --> 11:27.965
My conch told me
to come save you guys.
我的海螺告诉我
来拯救你们。

11:28.068 --> 11:30.724
Hooray for the magic conches!
神奇海螺万岁！

11:30.827 --> 11:35.275
All right, magic conch,
what do we do now?
好吧，神奇海螺，
我们现在做什么？

11:35.379 --> 11:37.689
Nothing.
没有什么。

11:37.793 --> 11:42.241
All hail the magic conch!
所有人都欢呼神奇海螺！

11:45.931 --> 11:49.827
All hail the magic conch!
所有人都欢呼神奇海螺！

12:03.517 --> 12:07.620
Ah... springtime
in Bikini Bottom.
啊……春天
在比基尼底部。

12:07.724 --> 12:09.137
All sea creatures
所有海洋生物

12:09.241 --> 12:12.482
have an innate sense
of the seasonal changes.
有一种与生俱来的感觉
的季节变化。

12:12.586 --> 12:13.724
Like the starfish.
就像海星一样。

12:13.827 --> 12:18.482
A quick survey
of his environment
快速调查
他的环境

12:18.586 --> 12:20.448
and he knows that...
他知道……

12:20.551 --> 12:22.000
It's spring!
春天来了！

12:22.103 --> 12:24.586
The starfish then sheds
his winter coat
然后海星就会蜕皮
他的冬衣

12:24.689 --> 12:28.344
and stores it away
safe for winter.
并将其存放起来
冬天安全。

12:33.862 --> 12:35.793
I better call the doctor
我最好打电话给医生

12:35.896 --> 12:38.551
'cause I've got spring fever!
因为我得了春季发烧！

12:38.655 --> 12:42.000
Good morning, little flowers.
早上好，小花们。

12:45.896 --> 12:47.862
Good morning, Squidward.
早上好，章鱼哥。

12:47.965 --> 12:50.068
Isn't it a lovely day?
这不是美好的一天吗？

12:50.172 --> 12:51.172
Huh.
呵呵。

12:51.206 --> 12:54.724
Did you say hello
to the flowers yet?
你打招呼了吗
到花了吗？

12:54.827 --> 12:57.172
Good morning, flowers.
早上好，鲜花。

13:00.275 --> 13:02.827
Gosh, I didn't know Squidward
had hay fever.
天哪，我不认识章鱼哥
有花粉症。

13:02.931 --> 13:04.172
I'll do him a kindness
我会善待他

13:04.275 --> 13:07.827
and planet
some hypoallergenic flowers.
和星球
一些防过敏的花。

13:14.413 --> 13:15.689
You're on your way.
你正在路上。

13:15.793 --> 13:18.344
I bet you're thirsty.
我敢打赌你一定渴了。

13:32.000 --> 13:36.310
I'm not taking my eyes off you.
我不会把目光从你身上移开。

13:44.275 --> 13:45.137
Hey, Spongebob.
嘿，海绵宝宝。

13:45.241 --> 13:46.241
Hi, Patrick.
嗨，帕特里克。

13:49.551 --> 13:51.827
How does this keep happening?
这种情况怎么持续发生？

13:56.758 --> 13:58.172
Hi.
你好。

14:05.000 --> 14:07.482
She's beautiful.
她很漂亮。

14:13.344 --> 14:15.862
Wow...
哇...

14:18.896 --> 14:22.724
What a magnificent sea horse.
多么雄伟的海马啊。

14:22.827 --> 14:23.827
I shall tame her.
我要驯服她。

14:23.931 --> 14:26.482
Who knows
what we can accomplish!
谁知道
我们能完成什么！

14:29.379 --> 14:31.827
"Because of her
mysterious behavior
“因为她
神秘的行为

14:31.931 --> 14:34.896
I have decided
to name her Mystery."
我已经决定了
给她起名叫谜男。”

14:35.000 --> 14:37.068
Hmm, now that I think about it
嗯，现在想想

14:37.172 --> 14:39.965
she's also very graceful
and majestic.
她也很优雅
和雄伟。

14:40.068 --> 14:43.689
Perhaps I should name her
Grace or Majesty
也许我应该给她起个名字
恩典或威严

14:43.793 --> 14:44.793
or Debbie.
或黛比。

14:51.172 --> 14:54.620
She must have spotted
my floral bookmark.
她一定发现了
我的花卉书签。

14:54.724 --> 14:57.310
She's coming this way.
她正朝这边过来。

14:57.413 --> 14:58.965
That's a girl.
那是一个女孩。

14:59.068 --> 15:00.103
Don't be afraid.
别害怕。

15:00.206 --> 15:02.758
I'm just a talking sponge
is all.
我只是一块会说话的海绵
就是全部。

15:38.827 --> 15:40.034
Gosh, Mystery
天哪，神秘

15:40.137 --> 15:41.493
that was the greatest day
of my life.
那是最伟大的一天
我的生活。

15:41.517 --> 15:45.689
Do you think
we'll be friends forever?
你认为
我们会永远是朋友吗？

15:48.724 --> 15:51.103
I'll take that as a "yes."
我会将其视为“是”。

15:55.758 --> 15:57.241
What the...?
什么……？

15:57.344 --> 16:00.758
Hey, Squidward, still riding
to work on the machine I see.
嘿，章鱼哥，还在骑马
在我看到的机器上工作。

16:00.862 --> 16:03.172
Don't say anything, Squidward.
别说话，章鱼哥。

16:03.275 --> 16:05.551
Remember your karma.
记住你的业力。

16:15.827 --> 16:17.137
Whoa, girl.
哇，女孩。

16:17.241 --> 16:21.172
Now, you wait out here
until I'm done with work.
现在，你在这儿等着
直到我完成工作。

16:21.275 --> 16:24.000
See you at the end of my shift.
我轮班结束时见。

16:24.103 --> 16:27.586
Hey, look, Mr. Krabs
put in a kiddy ride.
嘿，看，蟹老板
放入儿童骑行。

16:27.689 --> 16:30.137
Why don't you try it out?
你为什么不尝试一下呢？

16:32.344 --> 16:35.551
I can't find the coin slot.
我找不到投币口。

16:35.655 --> 16:36.655
Here it is.
这里是。

16:43.724 --> 16:46.068
Yee-ah! Help!
是啊！帮助！

16:46.172 --> 16:48.275
Kiddie ride on the loose!
小孩子逍遥法外！

16:48.379 --> 16:51.310
What's with all the ruckus?
到底是怎么回事？

16:51.413 --> 16:52.206
A monster...
一个怪物...

16:52.310 --> 16:54.241
scaring away me customers.
吓跑我的顾客。

16:54.344 --> 16:56.758
That's not a monster,
Mr. Krabs.
那不是怪物，
蟹老板。

16:56.862 --> 16:57.758
It's a horse.
这是一匹马。

16:57.862 --> 16:59.172
She's my friend.
她是我的朋友。

16:59.275 --> 17:01.034
Her name is Mystery.
她的名字叫谜男。

17:01.137 --> 17:03.551
You're a mystery, Spongebob.
你是个谜，海绵宝宝。

17:04.896 --> 17:06.034
Get rid of it.
摆脱它。

17:06.137 --> 17:08.655
Huh? Please,
Mr. Krabs,
let her stay.
啊？请，
蟹老板先生，
让她留下来。

17:08.758 --> 17:10.896
She won't hurt nobody no how.
她无论如何都不会伤害任何人。

17:11.000 --> 17:12.448
It's either you or Mystery.
要么是你，要么是谜男。

17:12.551 --> 17:16.793
I knew I should have named her
Debbie.
我知道我应该给她起名字
黛比.

17:18.896 --> 17:20.034
Spongebob, thanks
海绵宝宝，谢谢

17:20.137 --> 17:21.724
for finally
getting rid of that horse.
最后
摆脱那匹马。

17:21.827 --> 17:23.724
You're welcome, Mr. Krabs.
不客气，蟹老板。

17:23.827 --> 17:26.827
Now if we could just get rid
of Squidward.
现在如果我们能摆脱
章鱼哥。

17:28.275 --> 17:30.551
Good one, sir.
好的，先生。

17:30.655 --> 17:32.724
Ha! It worked, girl.
哈!成功了，女孩。

17:32.827 --> 17:33.965
I'll just keep you back here
我会把你留在这里

17:34.068 --> 17:35.827
until Patrick finishes
that stable
直到帕特里克完成
那个稳定

17:35.931 --> 17:37.586
I asked him to build.
我请他建造。

17:38.931 --> 17:41.827
Only eight more hours.
只剩八个小时了。

17:45.931 --> 17:46.724
No, Mystery.
不，谜男。

17:46.827 --> 17:48.206
You can't come out yet.
你还不能出来。

17:48.310 --> 17:50.413
If old man Krabs sees you
如果蟹老爷子看到你

17:50.517 --> 17:51.896
I'll lose my job.
我会失去工作。

17:52.000 --> 17:52.689
Wait a sec.
等一下。

17:52.793 --> 17:53.827
I'll bet you're hungry.
我敢打赌你一定饿了。

17:53.931 --> 17:54.931
How about some lunch?
吃点午饭怎么样？

18:03.103 --> 18:05.137
Shh, girl, you got
to be quiet, or...
嘘，女孩，你有
保持安静，或者...

18:05.241 --> 18:07.034
Spongebob, what was that?
海绵宝宝，那是什么？

18:07.137 --> 18:08.551
Is that horse in here?
那匹马在这里吗？

18:08.655 --> 18:09.793
No, Mr. Krabs.
不，蟹老板。

18:09.896 --> 18:13.000
I was just doing my imitation
of Mystery.
我只是在模仿
之谜。

18:14.103 --> 18:16.206
Well, keep working on it.
好吧，继续努力吧。

18:16.310 --> 18:18.758
That was terrible.
那太可怕了。

18:18.862 --> 18:19.965
That was close.
那很接近了。

18:20.068 --> 18:22.965
And from now on
no more high jinks.
并且从现在开始
不再有恶作剧。

18:23.068 --> 18:24.896
Order up!
赶快下单吧！

18:31.172 --> 18:32.862
Spongebob, where's my order?
海绵宝宝，我的订单在哪里？

18:32.965 --> 18:34.206
Did you look under the tray?
你看过托盘下面吗？

18:34.310 --> 18:36.689
Oh, no I didn't. Sorry.
哦，不，我没有。对不起。

18:36.793 --> 18:40.103
Spongebob, could you just
get my order?
海绵宝宝，你能不能
收到我的订单吗？

18:40.206 --> 18:41.862
They vanished.
他们消失了。

18:41.965 --> 18:45.758
Squidward, do you think
the Krusty Krab is haunted?
章鱼哥，你觉得
蟹堡王闹鬼了？

18:45.862 --> 18:47.862
What if they come for me next?
如果他们接下来来找我怎么办？

18:47.965 --> 18:49.586
I got to get out of here!
我必须离开这里！

18:49.689 --> 18:50.275
Spongebob...
海绵宝宝...

18:50.379 --> 18:51.862
there's no ghosts.
没有鬼魂。

18:51.965 --> 18:52.793
Oh.
哦。

18:52.896 --> 18:54.344
In case you've forgotten
万一你忘记了

18:54.448 --> 18:56.172
here's how things work.
事情是这样的。

18:56.275 --> 18:58.965
I order the food.
我点菜。

18:59.068 --> 19:00.482
You cook the food.
你做饭。

19:00.586 --> 19:02.862
Then the customer gets the food.
然后顾客拿到食物。

19:02.965 --> 19:04.241
We do that for 40 years
我们这样做了 40 年

19:04.344 --> 19:05.379
and then we die.
然后我们就死了。

19:05.482 --> 19:07.620
Sounds like a pretty
good deal to me.
听起来很漂亮
对我来说很划算。

19:07.724 --> 19:08.724
What do you say?
你怎么说？

19:09.517 --> 19:10.965
Yeah, I hear you, Squidward.
是的，我听到了，章鱼哥。

19:11.068 --> 19:12.206
I'll be right back.
我马上回来。

19:12.310 --> 19:13.103
What's that?
那是什么？

19:13.206 --> 19:14.379
Don't tell Mr. Krabs.
别告诉蟹老板先生。

19:14.482 --> 19:16.034
I've got it all under control.
一切都在我的掌控之中。

19:16.137 --> 19:18.172
Now then, you were saying?
那么现在，你是说？

19:19.103 --> 19:20.689
Just get my order.
拿到我的订单。

19:20.793 --> 19:22.620
You got it, Squidward.
你明白了，章鱼哥。

19:24.068 --> 19:25.310
Ghosts.
鬼魂。

19:26.517 --> 19:28.517
Mystery, you ate my hat.
谜男，你吃了我的帽子。

19:29.482 --> 19:31.551
Mystery, you ate my spatula!
谜男，你吃了我的锅铲！

19:31.655 --> 19:34.000
You ate all the Krabby patties.
你吃掉了所有的蟹黄饼。

19:34.103 --> 19:35.689
You ate the stove!
你把炉子吃了！

19:35.793 --> 19:37.482
You ate old man Jankins.
你吃了老詹金斯。

19:37.586 --> 19:40.206
I don't want to be a burden.
我不想成为负担。

19:41.758 --> 19:46.034
Folks, we have a minor situation
going on in the kitchen.
各位，我们有一个小情况
厨房里发生的事情。

19:46.137 --> 19:47.827
Where's our food?
我们的食物在哪里？

19:47.931 --> 19:49.103
I'm so hungry.
我好饿。

19:49.206 --> 19:51.275
This is my only lunch hour.
这是我唯一的午餐时间。

19:51.379 --> 19:53.620
Where's old man Jankins?
詹金斯老头在哪儿？

19:53.724 --> 19:54.551
Take it easy.
别紧张。

19:54.655 --> 19:56.379
The food's no good here anyway.
反正这里的食物也不好吃。

19:56.482 --> 19:58.620
Squidward,
what's going on in here?
章鱼哥，
这是怎么回事？

19:58.724 --> 20:01.137
Why don't you go
ask Cowbob Ranch Pans
你为什么不走
询问 Cowbob Ranch Pans

20:01.241 --> 20:03.689
and his faithful
companion Sir
Eats-a-lot.
和他的忠实信徒
同伴先生
吃很多。

20:03.793 --> 20:07.896
Spongebob, what's the meaning
of all these nicknames?
海绵宝宝，什么意思
所有这些昵称？

20:08.000 --> 20:09.724
David H. Jones!
大卫·H·琼斯！

20:09.827 --> 20:12.689
Mystery got a bellyache
from eating Krabby patties
谜男肚子疼
吃蟹肉饼

20:12.793 --> 20:14.965
so I made her a
bicarbonate of soda.
所以我给她做了一个
碳酸氢钠。

20:16.413 --> 20:18.379
What did I miss?
我错过了什么？

20:22.275 --> 20:23.862
So, my eyes arecorrect!
所以，我的眼睛是对的！

20:23.965 --> 20:26.931
You still have that horse after
I ordered you to get rid of it!
之后你仍然拥有那匹马
我命令你把它除掉！

20:27.034 --> 20:30.379
Well, now, I'm going to get rid
of it once and for all.
好吧，现在我要摆脱
一劳永逸。

20:30.482 --> 20:34.068
No, Mr. Krabs, please don't
make me give up Mystery!
不，蟹老板，请不要
让我放弃谜男！

20:34.172 --> 20:36.310
I know you think
she's just a horse
我知道你认为
她只是一匹马

20:36.413 --> 20:39.172
but she's more than that,
I tell you.
但她的意义还不止于此
我告诉你。

20:39.275 --> 20:40.689
She listens to me.
她听我的。

20:40.793 --> 20:44.275
She understands everything
I say and I understand her.
她什么都明白
我说，我理解她。

20:44.379 --> 20:45.965
She's my best friend.
她是我最好的朋友。

20:48.448 --> 20:50.413
Hey, who left this bowl
of onions here?
嘿，谁留下了这个碗
这里有洋葱吗？

20:50.517 --> 20:54.068
Spongebob, your story
has touched me heart.
海绵宝宝，你的故事
触动了我的心。

20:54.172 --> 20:57.000
Believe it or not,
I know what's it like
不管你信不信，
我知道那是什么样子

20:57.103 --> 20:58.965
to give up a best friend.
放弃最好的朋友。

20:59.068 --> 21:00.758
You do?
你做？

21:00.862 --> 21:02.931
I was five years old
那年我五岁

21:03.034 --> 21:06.310
and me father gave me a dollar.
我父亲给了我一美元。

21:06.413 --> 21:08.931
I loved that dollar.
我喜欢那美元。

21:09.034 --> 21:10.862
Loved it like a brother.
像兄弟一样喜欢它。

21:10.965 --> 21:13.827
Me and that dollar
went everywhere together.
我和那美元
一起到处去。

21:13.931 --> 21:16.482
What happened to the dollar,
Mr. Krabs?
美元怎么了
蟹老板？

21:16.586 --> 21:20.241
And one day at the beach
有一天在海滩

21:20.344 --> 21:22.482
it was so hot
天气太热了

21:22.586 --> 21:25.758
and I was so thirsty.
我太渴了。

21:25.862 --> 21:30.758
I spent it on a soda.
我把它花在了苏打水上。

21:30.862 --> 21:34.655
My best friend.
我最好的朋友。

21:38.206 --> 21:39.379
Would you get out of here?
你愿意离开这里吗？

21:39.482 --> 21:40.551
The point is, son
重点是儿子

21:40.655 --> 21:43.034
sometimes you have
to set things free
有时你有
使事物自由

21:43.137 --> 21:44.689
even though it's hard.
尽管这很难。

21:44.793 --> 21:45.586
Look at her.
看看她。

21:45.689 --> 21:48.034
She misses the great outdoors.
她怀念户外的美好时光。

21:48.137 --> 21:49.482
The wide open spaces
广阔的开放空间

21:49.586 --> 21:51.517
the rolling green pastures.
连绵起伏的绿色牧场

21:51.620 --> 21:55.896
The kitchen is no place
for a live horse.
厨房不是地方
为了一匹活马。

21:57.206 --> 22:00.206
All right, Mr. Krabs,
I understand.
好吧，蟹老板先生，
我明白了。

22:07.241 --> 22:08.275
Hey!
嘿！

22:08.379 --> 22:11.413
Okay, girl, you're free to go.
好了，姑娘，你可以走了。

22:11.517 --> 22:14.310
I can't keep you anymore.
我不能再留住你了

22:16.758 --> 22:19.965
I know it's hard for
you to understand
我知道这很难
你要明白

22:20.068 --> 22:21.827
but Mr. Krabs is right.
但蟹老板是对的。

22:21.931 --> 22:23.275
You belong in the wild.
你属于野外。

22:23.379 --> 22:26.172
Well, what are you waiting for?
那么，你还在等什么？

22:26.275 --> 22:29.965
Can't you see I don't
want you anymore?
难道你看不到我没有
想要你了吗？

22:30.068 --> 22:35.172
Just get out of here,
you stupid, dumb animal!
只要离开这里，
你这个愚蠢、愚蠢的动物！

22:40.310 --> 22:42.137
Well, she's gone
嗯，她走了

22:42.241 --> 22:44.689
and I'll never see her again.
我再也见不到她了。

22:44.793 --> 22:45.586
It's okay, son.
没关系，儿子。

22:45.689 --> 22:47.965
You did the proper thing.
你做了正确的事。

22:48.068 --> 22:49.448
She's free now
她现在有空了

22:49.551 --> 22:52.137
and we have no
right to separate
that wild animal
